# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: Other | Scene: start

translate zh strings:

    old "The Survival of Sarah Rose is an epic fantasy game. Production on TSSR is still ongoing."
    new "《莎拉·罗丝的生存》（The Survival of Sarah Rose）是一款史诗奇幻游戏。TSSR的制作仍在进行中。"

    old "What you are about to play is a work-in-progress."
    new "你即将体验的是一款仍在开发中的作品。"

    old "TSSR takes place in a dark fantasy setting."
    new "TSSR的故事发生在一个黑暗奇幻的世界中。"

    old "The events and stories depicted within, while fictional, may be triggering to some audiences."
    new "其中所描绘的事件与故事虽是虚构的，但对某些观众而言可能具有触发性影响。"

    old "Castle Reinmeer"
    new "雷恩米尔城堡矗立在罗萨纳国的中心地带。"

    old "The great castle rests at the heart of the nation of Rosanna."
    new "这座宏伟的城堡坐落于罗萨娜王国的心脏地带。"

    old "For centuries, it has been the home of the Rose family."
    new "几个世纪以来，这里都是罗斯家族的家园。"

    old "Ruling with both wisdom and strength, the Rose family ensured centuries of prosperity for the nation of Rosanna."
    new "罗斯家族以智慧与力量并济进行统治，确保了罗桑纳王国数百年的繁荣昌盛。"

    old "But nothing lasts forever and rumors of new dangers have begun to spread."
    new "但没有什么是永恒的，关于新危险的传闻已经开始流传。"

    old "An ambitious warlord to the east threatens war."
    new "东方一位野心勃勃的军阀正在威胁要发动战争。"

    old "Something has begun to stir the hearts of all creatures wicked."
    new "有什么东西开始在所有邪恶生灵的内心之中悄然搅动。"

    old "But perhaps most dangerous of all, enemies are rising from within Rosanna."
    new "但或许最危险的，是敌人正在从罗桑娜内部崛起。"

    old "Some wear their threats on their sleeves, whilst others hide their intentions behind smiling faces."
    new "有些人将威胁明摆在外，而另一些人则用微笑的面容掩盖真实意图。"

    old "The Rose family can feel it in the air..."
    new "罗斯家族能感受到空气中的那种气息……"

    old "Danger."
    new "危险。"

    old "Amidst these many dangers, Sarah Rose, eldest daughter of the Rose clan, must walk her path."
    new "在诸多危险之中，玫瑰家族的长女莎拉·罗斯必须走自己的道路。"

    old "She will need to learn who she can trust, who would seek to betray her, how to keep her nation safe, but above all..."
    new "她将不得不学会该信任谁、谁会想要背叛她、如何守护国家的安宁，但最重要的是……"

    old "She must survive."
    new "她必须活下来。"
